Corey wrote:

> can  a family of dragons assend? i.e. the family that slays
> together, stays together?

Thet seems impossible to me.

First, you will have to feed them or they will lose their tameness 
pretty quickly. There isn't enough food in the dungeon for a horde of 
dragons.

Also, to take them with you to another level, they need to be next to 
you when you take the stairs. With normal stairs, this is possible by 
takeing a few with you every time, but with the endgame portals, eight 
is the maximum.

Lastly, pets only increase in level by killing other monsters. If you 
have, say, twenty pet dragon babies, you will have to meet hundreds of 
other monsters to have them all kill monsters to get better. There 
aren't enough creatures in the dungeon for this.

